  "articleBody": "To turn a garage into a permitted ADU, begin with a property and jurisdiction review, then confirm the garage’s condition, develop a code-compliant layout, prepare design and engineering documents, submit the permit package, and complete construction and inspections. The right sequence helps reveal utility, access, ceiling-height, moisture, structural, and parking issues before work begins.",
